# Dataset Configuration
# This file shows how to configure DATASET_URL for local development
# 
# For Streamlit Cloud:
#   → Use Streamlit Secrets (see DATASET_CONFIGURATION.md)
#
# For Local Development:
#   → Copy this file to .env (will be auto-loaded by python-dotenv)
#   → Replace the URL with your real dataset download link
#   → git will ignore .env (do not commit real URLs)

# Replace with your actual direct-download URL
# Recommended sources:
#   • Hugging Face: https://huggingface.co/datasets/username/repo-name/resolve/main/unified_dataset.csv?download=true
#   • Google Drive: https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&id=FILE_ID
#   • AWS S3: https://bucket-name.s3.region.amazonaws.com/unified_dataset.csv
DATASET_URL=https://your-real-download-url-here/unified_dataset.csv
